{"kind":"stack","id":"s-sound","title":"How sounds are made","theme":{"background":"#fef9e7","foreground":"#1f2d3d","font":"Arial, sans-serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-t","content":"Vibration"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-e","content":"A vibration is a quick back-and-forth movement. Vibrations make sound."},{"type":"button","id":"c1-next","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"bee"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-q","content":"What makes the sound when a bee buzzes?"},{"type":"button","id":"c2-a","label":"Its wings vibrating quickly","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-b","label":"Its legs rubbing together","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-c","label":"Air leaving its mouth","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"Which of these makes a sound by vibrating?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"A ruler held on the edge of a desk and plucked","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"A still glass of water","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"A closed book on a shelf","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-t","content":"Pitch"},{"type":"text","id":"c4-e","content":"Pitch is how high or low a sound is. Fast vibrations make high sounds."},{"type":"button","id":"c4-next","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-q","content":"When you talk, what part of your body vibrates to make sound?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"Your vocal cords","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"Your knees","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-c","label":"Your elbows","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-q","content":"A drum is hit. Do you tap it gently or hit it hard?"},{"type":"button","id":"c6-a","label":"Tap it gently","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"Hit it hard","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-t","content":"A soft tap makes a quiet sound, because the drum skin vibrates only a little."},{"type":"button","id":"c7-next","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-t","content":"A hard hit makes a loud sound, because the drum skin vibrates a lot."},{"type":"button","id":"c8-next","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-q","content":"What happens to a sound when its vibrations are bigger?"},{"type":"button","id":"c9-a","label":"It gets louder","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-b","label":"It gets higher","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-c","label":"It stops","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-q","content":"Sound needs something to travel through. What is that called?"},{"type":"button","id":"c10-a","label":"A medium","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-b","label":"A magnet","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-c","label":"A battery","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c11","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c11-h","content":"You finished the sound and vibration lesson!"},{"type":"text","id":"c11-m","content":"Well done. You now know how sounds are made by vibrating things."}],"actions":[]}}
